    "title": "Texas Defeats No. 23 N.C. State in Maui Invitational",
    "text": "• Texas defeated No. 23 N.C. State with a score of 102-97.\n• The game was part of the Maui Invitational, where Texas claimed fifth place.\n• Texas led by as many as 15 points in the first half.\n• Jordan Pope scored 28 points for Texas.\n• Texas made 36 of 68 field goals, 10 of 24 three-pointers, and 20 of 26 free throws.\n• N.C. State's D.J. Horne scored 25 points.\n• N.C. State made 36 of 70 field goals, 8 of 21 three-pointers, and 17 of 22 free throws.\n• N.C. State had 16 assists.\n• Texas had 19 assists.\n• N.C. State outscored Texas 56-51 in the second half.\n• The game was played in Lahaina, Hawaii.",
